Subject: [PATCH 2/2] extension file naming: files renamed to the extended
 type's own name or the 'T where <clause>' shape (renames only; Linux x86_64,
 Swift 6.4.2) (coenttb/work#242)

---
 ...x.Kernel.File.Flush.swift => ISO_9945.Kernel.File.Flush.swift} | 0
 ....Target.Compat.swift => ISO_9945.Kernel.IO.Uring.Target.swift} | 0
 ...el.IO.Uring+Supported.swift => ISO_9945.Kernel.IO.Uring.swift} | 0
 Sources/Linux Kernel/{Exports.swift => POSIX.Kernel.IO.swift}     | 0
 .../{POSIX.Kernel.Thread.ID.swift => POSIX.Kernel.Thread.swift}   | 0
 5 files changed, 0 insertions(+), 0 deletions(-)
 rename Sources/Linux Kernel File/{Linux.Kernel.File.Flush.swift => ISO_9945.Kernel.File.Flush.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/{Linux.Kernel.IO.Uring.Target.Compat.swift => ISO_9945.Kernel.IO.Uring.Target.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/{Kernel.IO.Uring+Supported.swift => ISO_9945.Kernel.IO.Uring.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Linux Kernel/{Exports.swift => POSIX.Kernel.IO.swift} (100%)
 rename Sources/Linux Kernel/{POSIX.Kernel.Thread.ID.swift => POSIX.Kernel.Thread.swift} (100%)

diff --git a/Sources/Linux Kernel File/Linux.Kernel.File.Flush.swift b/Sources/Linux Kernel File/ISO_9945.Kernel.File.Flush.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Linux Kernel File/Linux.Kernel.File.Flush.swift
rename to Sources/Linux Kernel File/ISO_9945.Kernel.File.Flush.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/Linux.Kernel.IO.Uring.Target.Compat.swift b/Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/ISO_9945.Kernel.IO.Uring.Target.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/Linux.Kernel.IO.Uring.Target.Compat.swift
rename to Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/ISO_9945.Kernel.IO.Uring.Target.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/Kernel.IO.Uring+Supported.swift b/Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/ISO_9945.Kernel.IO.Uring.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/Kernel.IO.Uring+Supported.swift
rename to Sources/Linux Kernel IO Uring/ISO_9945.Kernel.IO.Uring.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Linux Kernel/Exports.swift b/Sources/Linux Kernel/POSIX.Kernel.IO.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Linux Kernel/Exports.swift
rename to Sources/Linux Kernel/POSIX.Kernel.IO.swift
diff --git a/Sources/Linux Kernel/POSIX.Kernel.Thread.ID.swift b/Sources/Linux Kernel/POSIX.Kernel.Thread.swift
similarity index 100%
rename from Sources/Linux Kernel/POSIX.Kernel.Thread.ID.swift
rename to Sources/Linux Kernel/POSIX.Kernel.Thread.swift
